---
# OCP-native Gateway API implementation: creating it makes the Ingress Operator deploy
# its Istio-based gateway control plane in openshift-ingress. Kuadrant needs it to be Ready.
# Ported from rhocpai-mvp-routing manifests/20-gateway/00-gatewayclass.yaml.
apiVersion: gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: GatewayClass
metadata:
  name: {{ name }}
spec:
  controllerName: {{ controller_name }}
